,title,link,text,language,family
0,Wakasihu language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wakasihu_language,"Wakasihu language ... Wakasihu, or Larike-Wakasihu after the two still-vigorous dialects, is an Austronesian language of Ambon Island in the Maluku Islands.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
1,"Język larike-wakasihu – Wikipedia, wolna encyklopedia",https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Język_larike-wakasihu,"Język larike-wakasihu – język austronezyjski używany w prowincji Moluki w Indonezji, przez grupę ludności na wyspie Ambon.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
2,Wakasihu language,https://grokipedia.com/page/wakasihu_language,"Larike-Wakasihu, of which Wakasihu is a primary dialect, is an Austronesian language spoken primarily on the western coast of Ambon Island in the Maluku Islands of Indonesia.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
3,"Larike-Wakasihu Language (ALO) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/alo/,Larike-Wakasihu is an endangered indigenous language of Indonesia. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. The language is used as a first language by some people in every generation of the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
4,Wakasihu language and alphabet - Omniglot,https://www.omniglot.com/writing/wakasihu.htm,"Wakasihu is a member of the East Central Maluku branch of the Malayo-Polynesian langauge family. It is spoken by about 13,000 people mainly on Ambon Island, one of the Maluku Islands in Maluku Province in eastern Indonesia, and also on nearby islands. Wakasihu is also known as Larike or Larike-Wakasihu.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
5,Larike-Wakasihu: Wakasihu hizkuntza,https://globalrecordings.net/eu/language/12774,"Larike-Wakasihu: Wakasihu hizkuntzari eta dialektoari buruzko informazioa. Audio Bibliako istorioak eta ikasgaiak. Deskargatu doako ebanjelizatzeko baliabideak, MP3ak, audio biblia aztertzeko tresnak, hizkuntza/dialekto informazioa.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
6,Larike-Wakasihu: Wakasihu language - globalrecordings.net,https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/12774,"Larike-Wakasihu: Wakasihu language and dialect information. Audio Bible stories and lessons. Download free evangelism resources, MP3s, audio bible study tools, language/dialect information.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
7,Austronesian Music - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/@austronesianmusic6149,"Hi everyone! Welcome to Austronesian Music🎶This channel mainly posts music from Austronesian countries and languages, and also other songs of languages of Southeast Asia.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
8,Larike-Wakasihu - alo (Austronesian) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/alo/,"Larike-Wakasihu (alo) is part of the Austronesian family and Austronesian, Malayo-Polynesian, Central-Eastern Malayo-Polynesian, Central Maluku, East, Seram, Nunusaku, Piru Bay, West, Hoamoal class.",Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
9,Glottolog 5.3 - Larike-Wakasihu,https://glottolog.org/resource/languoid/id/lari1255,Spoken L1 Language: Larike-Wakasihu.David M. Eberhard and Gary F. Simons and Charles D. Fennig 2025. Comment: Larike-Wakasihu (alo-alo) = 6b (Threatened). Glottocode: lari1255. ISO 639-3: alo.,Larike-Wakasihu,Austronesian
